DIS Network Utilities
=====================

To build the binaries, follow the instructions in "src".

For more information on DIS, obtain the military standard, "Protocol Data
Units for Entity Information and Entity Interaction in a Distributed
Interactive Simulation," October 31, 1991, from:

	Institute for Simulation and Training (IST)
	12424 Research Parkway, Suite 300
	Orlando, FL 32826
